      <div class="tip-row"><span class="tip-num">2.</span><span>The "Good-Fit Examples" field is the single highest-leverage input — always fill in 1–3 programs you already know fit</span></div>
      <div class="tip-row"><span class="tip-num">3.</span><span>For-profit: SBIR.gov and grants.gov are your primary verification sources for federal programs</span></div>
      <div class="tip-row"><span class="tip-num">4.</span><span>Nonprofit: cross-reference Candid or Instrumentl to verify foundation deadlines and award history</span></div>
      <div class="tip-row"><span class="tip-num">5.</span><span>Re-run with updated fields every quarter — your pipeline should be a living document</span></div>
      <div class="tip-row"><span class="tip-num">6.</span><span>Ask the AI to "go deeper on the top 3 matches" in a follow-up for detailed application guidance</span></div>
